e-delegated-review-dispatch.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-30-pose-review-subject-later-removal.amendments.jsonl\n.pose/specs/2026-08-22-pose-review-policy-v2-migration-and-verify-compat.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-09-pose-delegated-review-brief.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-08-pose-review-subject-and-scope-precision.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-10-pose-review-subject-classifies-engine-records.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-29-retained-review-survives-an-invalid-newer-approval.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-14-pose-security-validation-release-api-auth.md\n.pose/specs/2026-08-22-pose-release-closeout-skill-policy-link.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-19-pose-abm-review-soundness.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-18-pose-delegated-review-round-protocol.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-09-pose-delegated-review-capability.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-08-pose-review-subject-unclassified-removals.md\n.pose/specs/2026-11-02-pose-roadmap-reviews-findings.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-30-pose-review-subject-later-removal.md\n.pose/specs/2026-11-02-pose-milestone-review-proportional.amendments.jsonl\n.pose/specs/2026-08-08-pose-skill-closeout-gate-parity.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-20-review-policy-adoption-is-the-instances.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-26-pose-review-bundle-classifies-transfer-records.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-19-pose-abm-progressive-review.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-31-pose-review-approval-follows-children.md\n.pose/specs/2026-11-10-pose-review-check-time-and-output-regression-test.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-13-pose-review-approval-domain-preflight.md\n.pose/specs/2026-09-10-pose-shipped-review-profiles-are-schema-v2.md\n.pose/specs/2026-10-08-pose-mcp-review-attest-signed-only.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
